Scope. This licence covers the code, documentation, presets and artwork
written for this project. Files that were copied or adapted from other
projects keep their own licence headers, and the upstream licence texts are
kept under firmware/boards/LICENSES/ and companion/LICENSES/. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
lists every upstream source, its pinned commit and its licence.

Built firmware images also contain Zephyr RTOS (Apache-2.0), Nordic nrfx/MDK
(BSD-3-Clause), CMSIS (Apache-2.0) and picolibc/GCC runtime code from the
Zephyr SDK; docs/BINARY_NOTICES.md holds their notices and must accompany any
distributed image. This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Teenage Engineering or Kano. No Bluetooth radio firmware or SDK
payload is included.
